Table rowspan with multi-line content

```
|= Category       |= Item   |
| Fresh Fruits    | Apple   |
+ from local      |         |
+ farms           |         |
| ^               | Banana  |
.
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Item</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td rowspan="2">Fresh Fruits from local farms</td><td>Apple</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Banana</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
